Derived work notice
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portions of this project are ported from weread.koplugin, a WeRead client for
KOReader, which is licensed under AGPL-3.0-only:

    https://github.com/QiuYukang/weread.koplugin
    Copyright (C) 2026 finlater and contributors

Ported files carry a header naming their upstream counterpart:

    lua/weread/crypto.lua    <- weread/lib/crypto.lua
    lua/weread/protocol.lua  <- weread/lib/protocol.lua
    lua/weread/auth.lua      <- weread/lib/qr_login.lua
    lua/weread/reader_state.lua <- weread/lib/reader_state.lua
    lua/weread/content.lua   <- weread/lib/content.lua
    lua/weread/annotations.lua  <- weread/lib/annotations.lua
    lua/weread/progress.lua  <- weread/lib/read_report.lua

The protocol knowledge itself (request shapes, signature layout, shard
decoding, resource packaging) was cross-checked against the upstream
documentation in weread.koplugin/docs/weread-api-reference.md and against
live requests to weread.qq.com.

Because weread.koplugin is AGPL-3.0-only, this project is AGPL-3.0-only as a
whole and cannot be relicensed without removing every ported file.
